    "Castellum will start making real changes to the mail server for %@ — archiving, deleting, flagging, marking read and sending will all be applied remotely.\n\nUntil now this account has been in evaluation mode, where those actions were refused. You can return to read-only at any time." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "ca" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Castellum començarà a fer canvis reals al servidor de correu de %@: arxivar, eliminar, marcar amb bandera, marcar com a llegit i enviar s'aplicaran de manera remota.\n\nFins ara aquest compte ha estat en mode d'avaluació, en què aquestes accions es rebutjaven. Pots tornar a només lectura en qualsevol moment."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Castellum will start making real changes to the mail server for %@ — archiving, deleting, flagging, marking read and sending will all be applied remotely.\n\nUntil now this account has been in evaluation mode, where those actions were refused. You can return to read-only at any time."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Castellum empezará a hacer cambios reales en el servidor de correo de %@: archivar, eliminar, marcar con bandera, marcar como leído y enviar se aplicarán de forma remota.\n\nHasta ahora esta cuenta ha estado en modo de evaluación, en el que esas acciones se rechazaban. Puedes volver a solo lectura en cualquier momento."
          }
        }
      }
    },
