    "This can take a minute for large mailboxes. Your mail is safe; if you quit, nothing is lost." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ca" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Això pot trigar un minut en bústies grans. El teu correu és segur; si surts, no es perd res."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "This can take a minute for large mailboxes. Your mail is safe; if you quit, nothing is lost."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Esto puede tardar un minuto en buzones grandes. Tu correo está a salvo; si sales, no se pierde nada."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This can’t be undone. The message will be erased from the server." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ca" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
